---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Dr. Matthew Phillips, DDS — Author Profile"
metaTitle: "Dr. Matthew Phillips, DDS — Tempe Dentist & Author"
description: "Dental guides written and reviewed by Dr. Matthew Phillips, DDS, founder of 3rd Set Smiles in Tempe, AZ. Read his articles or book a visit online."
permalink: /blog/authors/dr-matthew-phillips/
breadcrumb:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Blog", url: "/blog/" }
  - { label: "Author", url: "/blog/authors/dr-matthew-phillips/" }
---
{% set author = authors['dr-matthew-phillips'] %}

<section class="page-hero blog-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span><a href="/blog/">Blog</a><span class="sep">›</span>Author</div>
    <h1>{{ author.name }}, {{ author.credential }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ author.profileSummary }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-wrap">
      <figure class="about-photo fade-in">
        <img src="{{ author.image }}" alt="{{ author.name }}, {{ author.credential }}" width="1120" height="928">
        <figcaption class="about-photo-info">
          <h3>{{ author.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ author.credential }} &middot; {{ author.role }}</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="about-content prose">
        <h2>About Dr. Phillips</h2>
        <p>Dr. Matthew Phillips grew up in Mesa and earned his Doctorate of Dental Surgery from the New York University College of Dentistry in 2004. He founded 3rd Set Smiles in Tempe, a veteran-owned practice where he provides general, cosmetic, extraction, implant and full-arch care himself.</p>

        <h2>How These Articles Are Written</h2>
        <p>Articles on this blog may be drafted with the help of writing tools. Every article is reviewed and approved by Dr. Phillips for clinical accuracy before it is published, and each one shows its review status. The articles are general education, not a diagnosis; treatment decisions need an in-person exam.</p>

        <h2>Articles by Dr. Phillips</h2>
        <ul>
          {%- for post in collections.blog %}{% if post.data.authorId == 'dr-matthew-phillips' %}
          <li><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></li>
          {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
        </ul>

        <p><a class="btn-primary" href="/about/">View full practice biography</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{{ {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "ProfilePage",
  "mainEntity": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "@id": (site.domain + "/#dr-phillips"),
    "name": author.name,
    "honorificSuffix": author.credential,
    "jobTitle": author.role,
    "description": author.profileSummary,
    "url": (site.domain + "/about/"),
    "image": author.image | absUrl(site.domain),
    "worksFor": {
      "@type": "Dentist",
      "@id": (site.domain + "/#dentist"),
      "name": site.name
    }
  }
} | jsonStringify | safe }}
</script>
